Subject: [PATCH] [XPU] Inkling 2 Mini: XPU model port (Triton kernels,
 NVFP4/MXFP8 experts, TP2, DSpark) + one-shot P2P all-reduce

Native Intel XPU path for Inkling 2 Mini on 2x Arc Pro B65 (TP2):
- vllm/models/inkling2/xpu/: model, attention, short-conv, MoE, loop
  controllers, DSpark drafter, Triton kernel suite, pure-torch reference
- tests/models/inkling2/xpu/: kernel gates + llama.cpp quality oracle
- scripts/: BF16 dequant, GGUF loop patch
- xpu_communicator: optional one-shot P2P all-reduce (VLLM_XPU_ONESHOT_AR)
- inkling2/__init__.py: dispatch current_platform.is_xpu() -> .xpu.model
